<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:      1 The above financial results reviewed and recommended by the audit committee were approved by Board of Directors at its meeting held on 07 02 2022 at Chennai      2 This results have been subjected to Limited review by the Statutory auditor of the company in terms of regulation 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulation 2015  the Limited review report doesn’t contain any qualification reservation adverse comment the review report has been filed with stock exchanges and its available on the company website      3 Financial results for all the period presented have been prepared in accordance with recognitions and measurements Principles of IND AS notified under the companies Indian Accounting Standards Rules 2015 has amended from time to time and other General Acceptable Accounting Practices and Principles.      4 The Operation of the Company is into one segment Domestic Appliances has identified by the Chief Operating Decision Maker therefore there is one reportable segment in accordance with IND AS 108 Operating Segments      5 As per the Directives of both the Central and State Governments in the wake of Covid 19 Pandemic the company had suspended operations across various locations with effect from 10 05 2021 operations have been received have been resumed in the phased manner at the various locations from 07 06 2021 taking cognizance of the governments views around resuming the manufacturing activities with controlled entry exit facilities and after obtaining necessary permissions in this behalf The Company expects to recover the carrying amount all its assets including inventories receivables and loans in the ordinary course of business based on information available on current economic conditions      6 Figures for the comparative period have been regrouped were ever necessary in conformity with current period classification</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
